# Wireframe: Issue Form (Modal)

## Purpose & Flow Context

Modal overlay for creating or editing an issue. Entry: click "+ New Issue" (Issue List) or "Edit" (Issue Detail). Exit: submit (→ list/detail with updated data) or cancel (→ previous screen).

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Single-column modal overlay. 4px cadence.

**App-shell**: Modal overlay on top of the app shell (no shell chrome inside modal).

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Modal header | Title + close button | Sticky top of modal |
| Form body | Title input, description textarea, metadata fields | Scrollable |
| Actions | Cancel + Submit buttons | Sticky bottom |

**Content hierarchy**:
1. Title input — primary field, auto-focused
2. Description — main content body
3. Metadata — dropdowns for status/assignee/priority/labels/project
4. Actions — submit or abandon

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [X]  {New Issue / Edit Issue}                            |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  _________________________________________________        |  |
|  |  | Issue title...                                    |     |  |
|  |  _________________________________________________        |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  _________________________________________________        |  |
|  |  | Description (optional)...                       |     |  |
|  |  |                                                |     |  |
|  |  |                                                |     |  |
|  |  _________________________________________________        |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  [Status▼] [Priority▼] [Assignee▼] [Labels▼]              |  |
|  |  [Project▼] [Cycle▼]                                      |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |               [Cancel]  [Create Issue]                     |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Close | Button (icon) | [X] top-right, also Escape key | Discards unsaved input (no confirmation) |
| Title input | Input | Single-line, focused on mount, required | Max length validation |
| Description | Textarea | Multiline, optional | Resize vertical only |
| Status dropdown | DropdownMenu | Select from workflow statuses | Default to "Todo" |
| Priority dropdown | DropdownMenu | None / Urgent / High / Medium / Low | Default to "Medium" |
| Assignee dropdown | DropdownMenu | User list with search | "Unassigned" option |
| Labels dropdown | DropdownMenu (multi-select) | Checkbox list of labels | Create new label option |
| Project dropdown | DropdownMenu | Project list | None option |
| Cycle dropdown | DropdownMenu | Cycle list for selected project | Disabled if no project selected |
| Submit | Button (primary) | Validates and submits | Disabled if title empty; loading state on submit |
| Cancel | Button (secondary) | Closes modal | Discards input |

## Data Display

Form fields — no data table.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Modal title | "New Issue" or "Edit Issue" | Context-dependent |
| Title placeholder | "Issue title..." | Descriptive, not "Enter issue title" |
| Description placeholder | "Add description... (optional)" | Clear that it's optional |
| "Create Issue" | Primary submit action | Changes to "Save Changes" in edit mode |
| "Cancel" | Abandon without saving | — |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Form fields empty (create) or pre-filled (edit). See sketch above.

### Loading

Submit button shows spinner, form fields disabled. Store: `isLoading` on mutation.

```
|               [Cancel]  [⟳ Saving...]                         |
```

### Error

Server validation or network error.

| Field | Rule | Error Message |
|-------|------|---------------|
| Title | Required | "Title is required" |
| Title | Max 255 chars | "Title must be 255 characters or fewer" |

Server errors shown as a banner below the header.

```
|  [!] Failed to create issue. Network error.  [Dismiss]          |
```

### Success

Modal closes, parent view refreshes. Toast: "Issue created" or "Issue updated".

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Modal centered, max-width 640px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Modal width 90vw |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-screen sheet instead of modal; metadata dropdowns → stacked vertical |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `dialog` with `aria-modal="true"` |
| Heading order | h2 (modal title) inside dialog |
| Reading / Focus order | Focus trap: title → description → metadata → actions → close |
| Accessible names | Close button: `aria-label="Close"`; form fields: visible `<label>` elements |
| Keyboard operability | Tab between fields; Enter to submit; Escape to close; Arrow keys in dropdowns |
| Target size | All fields ≥24×24 CSS px; close button ≥24×24 CSS px |
| Focus not obscured | Modal overlay covers all behind; focus trapped inside |
| Non-color intent | Error states use icon + text, not color alone |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*
